          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yosefu yaakoba baganda be n'ab'omu ndhu ya ise ati: “Ka nje mmanhise kyabazinga nti baganda bange, n'ab'omu ndhu ya lata wange abaabanga mu nsi y'e Kanaani, baidhie ye ndi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.46.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.46.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 46:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ndidha kumukobera nti muli baayi, era nti muleese entaama dhaimwe, n'embuzi dhaimwe, n'ente dhaimwe, era n'ebyaimwe byonabyona bye muli nabyo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.46.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.46.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 46:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kyabazinga bw'anaabeeta n'ababuuza ati, ‘Mukola mulimo ki.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.46.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.46.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 46:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Munaamwiramu muti, ‘Ife abagheereza bo, tubaire baayi okuva mu buto bwaife n'okutuusa mpegaano, ng'oti ni badhaadha baife bwe baali’—olwo musobole okuba mu kiketezo ky'e Gosheni, kuba kya muzizo eri Abamisiri okuba aghalala n'abaayi.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.46.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.46.34"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
